  "limits": "Original unbranded short-mounted ship engine-order telegraph instrument. Thick brass-colored drum/bezel, pale radial command dial with original AHEAD/ASTERN/FULL/HALF/SLOW/STOP and simplified STAND/DONE labels, fixed central pointer, short flange mount and partial side linkage. Complete instrument rather than invented full pedestal. Original approximate0.420x0.140x0.431m envelope, not reference-measured. Photograph source caption identifies SteamTugYelta engine-room unit,2011; photographer/license not independently established. Short mount, partial side-link termination and back cover generic/inferred; cropped long grip and hidden internals not reconstructed. No signaling/engine control/rig/load/safety/collider/Unity certification or universal shading equivalence.",
